      "sourceTextSha256": "5c89e355062b477aa632ff11ed5b4b058834a2a28f1aed4b16618fd2e651069e",
      "text": "An extraordinary 18-day journey through Peru and Ecuador, where the climate, altitude and scenery change dramatically along the way. Begin in Lima on the Pacific coast, then enter the Amazon rainforest on an Aria Amazon cruise. From the jungle, climb into the Andes to explore the Sacred Valley, Machu Picchu, Vinicunca Rainbow Mountain and Cusco. In Ecuador, discover Quito, the Mashpi cloud forest and, finally, the Galapagos Islands.",
